  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Constitutional Reform</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to Constitutional Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att bidra med information och analys kring de r&#xe4;ttsreformer som utarbetas I en bred deltagande process. Reformerna kommer att p&#xe5;verka grundlagen och ska d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r godk&#xe4;nnas I en folkomr&#xf6;stning. Accion Ciudadana vill skapa kunskap om processen och f&#xf6;rslagen via en virtuell plattform och aktiviteter i landets regioner. Projektet inneh&#xe5;ller ocks&#xe5; en valobservations insats under folkomr&#xf6;stningen. 

Projektet ska p&#xe5;g&#xe5; ett &#xe5;r och budgeten &#xe4;r 4 700 000 kr.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention targets the process of Reform of the Guatemalan Constitution, in the provisions regarding the Justice Sector, as an opportunity to address the Judiciary Independence, the Access to Justice for marginalized groups in a framework of legal pluralism, and the combat to corruption in the Guatemalan Justice Sector.   The counterparts of this program,  is Accion Ciudadana, the local chapter of Transparency International. Is a high profile organisation in Guatemala, acting as a champion for the cause of anti corruption and transparency.  AC mission is to promote public aware and  transparency in public administration in Guatemala.</narrative>
  </description>
